# Production client env, embedded by Vite at build time (Vercel `vite build`).
# These are PUBLIC by design: the Supabase URL and the *anon* key ship in every
# browser bundle. Security is enforced server-side by Row Level Security (see
# supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql) — the anon key alone can do nothing without
# a member row + auth session. Server-only secrets (service_role, Base44, MP,
# HMAC) must NEVER live here — they go in Vercel project env without VITE_.
